WEBVTT

00:00:05.794 --> 00:00:08.188
Okay, guys, guys, huddle up.

00:00:08.232 --> 00:00:09.276
[bird screeches in distance]

00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:10.843
[growling]:
Growly, growly, growl.

00:00:10.887 --> 00:00:12.584
Now, take it easy, Growly Pete.

00:00:12.627 --> 00:00:13.933
I feel bad for them.

00:00:13.977 --> 00:00:16.631
It looks like they got
beat up by a rainbow.

00:00:16.675 --> 00:00:17.937
First things first,

00:00:17.981 --> 00:00:19.721
these Trolls need
some serious cheering up,

00:00:19.765 --> 00:00:21.810
and we're gonna
have to go top-shelf.

00:00:21.854 --> 00:00:22.724
Oh.

00:00:22.768 --> 00:00:24.770
Now, when you say "top-shelf,"

00:00:24.813 --> 00:00:26.119
-y-you don't mean...
-That's right.

00:00:26.163 --> 00:00:28.469
We need to sing them
the most important songs

00:00:28.513 --> 00:00:31.385
in the history of music.

00:00:31.429 --> 00:00:33.039
Yes, but which ones?

00:00:34.084 --> 00:00:35.259
All of them.

00:00:35.302 --> 00:00:37.609
And when you say
"all of them..."

00:00:37.652 --> 00:00:38.871
-♪ Yo, I'll tell you what
I want ♪ -["Wannabe" playing]

00:00:38.915 --> 00:00:40.525
♪ What I really, really want

00:00:40.568 --> 00:00:42.092
♪ So tell me what you want,
what you really, really want ♪

00:00:42.135 --> 00:00:43.745
♪ I'll tell you what I want,
what I really, really want ♪

00:00:43.789 --> 00:00:45.486
♪ So tell me what you want,
what you really, really want ♪

00:00:45.530 --> 00:00:47.314
-♪ I wanna, I wanna, I wanna,
I wanna ♪ - Ha, ha, ha, ha ♪

00:00:47.358 --> 00:00:49.316
♪ I wanna really, really,
really wanna zig-a-zag, ah ♪

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:50.927
-♪ Who? Who? Who-who?
-["Who Let the Dogs Out" plays]

00:00:50.970 --> 00:00:53.016
♪ Who let the dogs out?

00:00:53.059 --> 00:00:55.322
-♪ Who? Who? Who-who?
-[squeaking rhythmically]

00:00:55.366 --> 00:00:57.237
♪ Who let the dogs out?

00:00:57.281 --> 00:00:58.891
♪ Who? Who? Who-who?

00:00:58.935 --> 00:01:00.284
-♪ It's such a good vibration
-["Good Vibrations" playing]

00:01:00.327 --> 00:01:02.503
♪ Yeah, come on,
come on, come on ♪

00:01:02.547 --> 00:01:04.505
♪ It's such a sweet sensation

00:01:04.549 --> 00:01:06.725
-♪ Oppa Gangnam style
-["Gangnam Style" playing]

00:01:06.768 --> 00:01:08.770
[rhythmic grunting]

00:01:08.814 --> 00:01:10.163
♪ Gangnam style

00:01:10.207 --> 00:01:11.991
♪ O-O-O-O

00:01:12.035 --> 00:01:13.514
-♪ Oppa Gangnam style
-["Hey Baby" playing]

00:01:13.558 --> 00:01:15.821
♪ Hey, pretty girl,
what you doing tonight? ♪

00:01:15.864 --> 00:01:17.301
-♪ Gangnam style
-♪ I wanna see

00:01:17.344 --> 00:01:19.085
-♪ What you got in store
-♪ O-O-O-O

00:01:19.129 --> 00:01:21.305
-♪ Oppa Gangnam style
-["Party Rock Anthem" playing]

00:01:21.348 --> 00:01:24.395
♪ Party rock is
in the house tonight ♪

00:01:24.438 --> 00:01:27.702
-Come on! -♪ Everybody just
have a good time ♪

00:01:27.746 --> 00:01:31.532
-Rave on, party on! -♪ Party
rock is in the house tonight ♪

00:01:31.576 --> 00:01:33.752
♪ We just wanna see ya

00:01:33.795 --> 00:01:35.014
♪ Tell 'em, Poppy

00:01:35.058 --> 00:01:36.537
[echoing]:
♪ Shake that.

00:01:36.581 --> 00:01:38.757
[wind whistling softly]

00:01:40.324 --> 00:01:42.021
TUMBLEWEED:
You suck!

00:01:45.068 --> 00:01:47.679
Now, I want you three
to sit in here

00:01:47.722 --> 00:01:49.811
and think about
what you've just done.

00:01:49.855 --> 00:01:52.466
-That was a crime against
music. -POPPY: Wait, no.

00:01:52.510 --> 00:01:56.035
We're here to warn you
about Barb, the Queen of Rock.

00:01:56.079 --> 00:01:58.211
[sighs] Sweetie, I already know

00:01:58.255 --> 00:02:02.737
and have heard about this Queen
Barb and her fancy World Tour.

00:02:02.781 --> 00:02:04.217
Now, if you'll excuse me,

00:02:04.261 --> 00:02:09.353
I got to go wash what you call
music out of my ears.

00:02:09.396 --> 00:02:10.571
[gasps]

00:02:10.615 --> 00:02:11.572
[chuckles]:
Oh.

00:02:11.616 --> 00:02:13.270
You in real trouble now.

00:02:13.313 --> 00:02:14.575
Right, Aunt Delta?

00:02:14.619 --> 00:02:16.969
-Keep an eye on 'em,
Growly Pete. -Yes!

00:02:17.013 --> 00:02:19.058
Growly, growly, growly, growl.

00:02:19.102 --> 00:02:22.714
No, no. Music should bring us
together, not divide us!

00:02:22.757 --> 00:02:25.456
-Sugar.
-[sighs]

00:02:25.499 --> 00:02:27.501
Well, I knew it.

00:02:27.545 --> 00:02:30.287
"Who Let the Dogs Out."
Too far.

00:02:30.330 --> 00:02:31.810
Okay, Branch.

00:02:31.853 --> 00:02:34.943
You can say "I told you so."
I know you want to.

00:02:36.771 --> 00:02:39.731
♪

00:02:44.779 --> 00:02:47.043
Y-You did great
out there, Poppy.

00:02:48.479 --> 00:02:49.523
[Poppy shrieks]

00:02:49.567 --> 00:02:50.785
I'll never survive
the big house.

00:02:50.829 --> 00:02:52.961
-We've got to get out of here.
-I know.

00:02:53.005 --> 00:02:55.616
That was such a rad medley.
I can't believe it didn't work.

00:02:55.660 --> 00:02:57.314
Tell me about it.
I did the splits.

00:02:57.357 --> 00:02:58.706
No one even clapped.

00:02:58.750 --> 00:03:00.230
Am I not cute anymore?!

00:03:00.273 --> 00:03:01.231
Come on!

00:03:01.274 --> 00:03:03.102
Maybe my dad was right.

00:03:03.146 --> 00:03:06.018
The other Trolls are different
in ways I was not prepared for.

00:03:06.062 --> 00:03:09.326
Some Trolls, they don't
just want to have fun.

00:03:09.369 --> 00:03:12.459
Anybody got a plan B?

00:03:12.503 --> 00:03:14.853
Plan B? Right up here.

00:03:16.985 --> 00:03:20.119
Step one:
escape from Lonesome Flats.

00:03:21.468 --> 00:03:24.819
[snorting, spitting noisily]

00:03:24.863 --> 00:03:26.430
[sighs] Plan B it is.

00:03:26.473 --> 00:03:28.301
I guess we're going home.

00:03:28.345 --> 00:03:29.781
HICKORY:
Whoo-hey!

00:03:29.824 --> 00:03:31.043
[screams]

00:03:32.044 --> 00:03:34.394
It ain't right
to put you in jail

00:03:34.438 --> 00:03:36.657
'cause your music's different.

00:03:36.701 --> 00:03:38.094
It seems some folks round here

00:03:38.137 --> 00:03:39.834
don't appreciate a rad medley
when they hear one.

00:03:39.878 --> 00:03:41.053
[bell dings]

00:03:41.749 --> 00:03:43.011
Let's skedaddle.

00:03:43.055 --> 00:03:45.144
Yes! Mission back on!

00:03:45.188 --> 00:03:47.886
Branch! Branch!
You can stop rescuing us.

00:03:48.713 --> 00:03:50.671
[gasps]

00:03:50.715 --> 00:03:52.586
Poppy, you don't even know
who this is.

00:03:52.630 --> 00:03:54.371
I'm Queen Poppy.
What's your name?

00:03:54.414 --> 00:03:55.676
Name's Hickory.

00:03:55.720 --> 00:03:57.287
Branch, this is Hickory.
Hickory, this is Branch.

00:03:57.330 --> 00:03:59.115
Enough with the formalities.
Let's go!

00:03:59.158 --> 00:04:01.900
-Uh, this is Mr. Dinkles,
by the way. -[squeaks]

00:04:03.075 --> 00:04:04.903
I said let's skedaddle! Hyah!

00:04:04.946 --> 00:04:06.513
Go get 'em, Clampers!

00:04:06.557 --> 00:04:08.254
[hisses, blabbering]

00:04:08.298 --> 00:04:09.734
♪

00:04:09.777 --> 00:04:12.040
[screams] This was
my plan C, by the way.

00:04:12.084 --> 00:04:13.781
♪ I feel it coming like
a highball train ♪

00:04:13.825 --> 00:04:15.479
-Charge!
-♪ Bearing down on

00:04:15.522 --> 00:04:17.698
-♪ The end of the line
-[Hickory shouting]

00:04:17.742 --> 00:04:19.178
Hyah! Hyah!

00:04:19.222 --> 00:04:20.440
♪ I see the black clouds...

00:04:20.484 --> 00:04:21.615
POPPY:
Oh, no! Hickory!

00:04:21.659 --> 00:04:23.269
I got it, Queen Poppy.

00:04:23.313 --> 00:04:25.358
DELTA DAWN:
Don't let them get away!

00:04:25.402 --> 00:04:26.664
[screaming, shouting]

00:04:26.707 --> 00:04:28.622
♪ I'm feeling meaner
than an old bobcat ♪

00:04:28.666 --> 00:04:29.928
[Biggie sobbing]

00:04:29.971 --> 00:04:31.190
-[blabbering]
-♪ I got the hammer down

00:04:31.234 --> 00:04:33.453
-♪ And won't look back
-[laughs]

00:04:33.497 --> 00:04:36.195
♪ My mind is headed down
a one-way track ♪

00:04:36.239 --> 00:04:39.938
♪ I'm leaving Lonesome Flats,
I'm leaving Lonesome Flats ♪

00:04:39.981 --> 00:04:41.940
[whoops] Yeah!

00:04:41.983 --> 00:04:43.202
[blabbering]

00:04:43.246 --> 00:04:44.247
[screams]

00:04:45.291 --> 00:04:46.901
Yeah! [whoops]

00:04:46.945 --> 00:04:48.729
-Come on, Growly Pete!
-Uh-oh.

00:04:48.773 --> 00:04:49.904
-Do your thing!
-[whooping]

00:04:49.948 --> 00:04:51.384
No one can escape my mustache.

00:04:51.428 --> 00:04:52.733
That's how you do it!

00:04:52.777 --> 00:04:54.300
[gasping]

00:04:54.344 --> 00:04:56.172
-Hyah!
-[laughs] That tickles.

00:04:56.215 --> 00:04:58.391
Branch, hold on to Mr. Dinkles!

00:04:58.435 --> 00:04:59.697
[yelling]

00:04:59.740 --> 00:05:01.786
[straining]

00:05:01.829 --> 00:05:04.049
[yelling and straining
continue]

00:05:06.399 --> 00:05:09.054
-Hyah!
-We're gonna get you now!

00:05:14.277 --> 00:05:16.235
[screaming]

00:05:16.279 --> 00:05:17.280
[whoops]

00:05:17.323 --> 00:05:19.586
POPPY:
Hickory, look out!

00:05:19.630 --> 00:05:21.458
[blabbering]

00:05:23.286 --> 00:05:24.591
We're not gonna make it!

00:05:24.635 --> 00:05:26.985
Oh, yes, we are.

00:05:29.857 --> 00:05:33.861
-♪ Yeah, I'm leaving
Lonesome Flats. ♪ -[screaming]

00:05:33.905 --> 00:05:36.603
Well, I hope
Pop Trolls can swim.

00:05:36.647 --> 00:05:38.866
[screaming]

00:05:41.391 --> 00:05:42.914
Oh, for Pete's sake.

00:05:42.957 --> 00:05:45.830
-Well, dangity-doodly.
-Dangity-doodly.

00:05:45.873 --> 00:05:47.440
[Clampers grunts]

00:05:47.484 --> 00:05:50.487
[relaxing music playing]

